          "type": "feature_grid",
          "id": "life",
          "variant": "cards",
          "items": [
            {
              "title": "The year",
              "body": "Twelve clues, one quilt. Fabric list in January, no picture.",
              "href": "/clues"
            },
            {
              "title": "The guesses",
              "body": "A wall of wrong ideas. We keep them up on purpose."
            },
            {
              "title": "The reveal",
              "body": "December. Then a second sew for the people who refused to guess and just followed.",
              "href": "/clues"
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "bg": "none",
            "width": "wide"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "join_band",
          "id": "join",
          "title": "Take an envelope",
          "body": "Dues cover the room and the printing. Fabric is your January problem.",
          "ctaLabel": "See dues",
          "style": {
            "bg": "brand",
            "align": "center",
            "divider": "notch"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "slug": "about",
      "title": "About",
      "nav": true,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "hero",
          "id": "a-hero",
          "variant": "pattern",
          "title": "About {{guild_name}}",
          "subtitle": "Sample text — replace me: A guild whose program is not knowing.",
          "style": {
            "bg": "none",
            "align": "center"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "rich_text",
          "id": "a-body",
          "variant": "prose",
          "heading": "How we started",
          "html": "<p><em>Sample text — replace me:</em> Pattern designers sell mysteries. This is a guild that lives inside one together. {{guild_name}} writes its own clues or licenses one and then obeys it as a group, which is harder than it sounds.</p>",
          "style": {
            "bg": "tint",
            "width": "narrow",
            "divider": "notch"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "feature_grid",
          "id": "a-year",
          "variant": "numbered",
          "items": [
            {
              "title": "January list",
              "body": "Yardage. No mood board. If you cannot bear that, wait a year."
            },
            {
              "title": "Midsummer panic",
              "body": "Normal. Do not buy extra. The clue will use what it said."
            },
            {
              "title": "December",
              "body": "The picture. The groans. The extra batting run."
            }
          ],
          "style": {
            "bg": "none",
            "width": "wide",
            "layout": "framed"
          },
          "heading": "A year with us"
        }
      ]
    },
